      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently, \n1. set new disk size and save to shared preference\n2. restart the app, which closes the VM\n3. app starts and resizes the disk before the VM service\n\nOr do you think the resizing should happen before the restart of the app? like:\n1. set new disk size and save to shared preference\n2. stop the VM service\n3. resizes the disk\n3. restart the app, and start the VM service\n\nBut the user feels the same. This page only accessible when the VM is running. So we definitely need to restart the VM.",
      "parentUuid": "8cc1859f_9da0c55e",
      "revId": "592b52a867da765935fb34ed5ae983c7321e6549",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
