      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah I messed up the index, should be 3. 4.\nI think the boot time is acceptable. I don\u0027t actively feel extra latency.\nAnd I agree with your feeling, The first approach is a little bit weird. But it is simple. And I think the second approach makes sense when the user can get to the disk resize pages when the VM is not running. We should support it in the future? For the user encounters a shortage of storage and turns to reduce the size of the VM disk.",
